# IIQ Java Import Patterns

```java
// Standard library
import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;

// SailPoint API
import sailpoint.api.SailPointContext;
import sailpoint.object.Identity;

// Project packages
import sailpoint.service.MetadataValidationService;
import sailpoint.web.rest.dto.ValidationResultDTO;
```

**Import order:** `java.*` → `javax.*` → `sailpoint.api`/`object` → `sailpoint.service`/`web` → static imports last

**Never wildcard imports** — always explicit (`import java.util.List` not `import java.util.*`)
